  "question": {
    "text": "The magnetic field at the centre of a circular coil of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi></math>, due to current I flowing through it, is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>. The magnetic field at a point along the axis at a distance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math> from the centre is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
